# Pipeline outputs. The documented commands write ./processed_data, ./irt_data,
# ./trimmed and ./trimmed_irt into the repo root, and a full run is ~400 MB of
# derived data. The trailing wildcards matter: --max_seconds and --max_samples
# encourage suffixed variants (processed_data_285, irt_data_8740samp, ...) and
# the exact-name patterns did not catch those.
processed_data*/
irt_data*/
trimmed*/

# Written to the working directory by reproc_cpCST.py; both append across runs.
errs.log
crash_count.csv

# Diagnostic plots written alongside the processed CSVs
*_repaired.png

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
